## Patent Grant

Contributors grant recipients a perpetual, worldwide, royalty-free patent license covering their contributions to the extent necessary to use, modify, and distribute those contributions.

---

## Termination

Any rights granted under this License terminate automatically upon violation of its terms.

Rights may be reinstated if the violation is cured within thirty (30) days of receiving notice.

Termination does not eliminate obligations already incurred under the Reciprocal Fork Return Requirement for distributed versions.

